  << /ActualText (ARRIVAL \057 Product \046 Design Lead \0502015\0232022\051\nDeveloping a toolchain for configuring vehicle electric and software architecture with some automations that never existed before in automotive\056 From idea through prototype and launch to production and proved the efficiency\056 \nHands\055on designed the solution inventing ways to simplify and automate everything possible\056\nOwned product direction\054 roadmap and feature prioritisation\054 while leading a team of 12 engineers from concept through production\056\nHired and mentored Product Designers in nearby products \050vehicle online monitoring and diagnostics\054 vehicle configuration\054 vehicle software update\051\056)
